#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:8
msgid "F4 收敛后的迭代边界"
msgstr "Iteration boundaries after F4 consolidation"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:10
msgid ""
"当前工作只围绕 STM32F4、实际公共消费者和精炼工程流程。全部 vendor 来源保留， 生产支持、默认构建和依赖库存分别管理。原跨系列规划从 "
"[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/next-"
"iterations.md) 追溯，不作为新的生产任务清单。"
msgstr ""
"Current work focuses on STM32F4, actual public consumers and a concise "
"engineering workflow. All vendor sources are retained; production support, "
"default builds and dependency inventory are managed separately. The original"
" cross-series plan remains traceable at the [fixed prior "
"source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/next-"
"iterations.md) and is not a new production task list."

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "顺序"
msgstr "Order"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "退出条件"
msgstr "Exit condition"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "行为保全与清理"
msgstr "Behavior preservation and cleanup"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "四个 F407 Board、两种密度、有效 OS 和原有模式可装配；退出平台无悬空代码、测试和命令"
msgstr ""
"Four F407 Boards, two densities, applicable OS backends and existing modes "
"assemble; retired platforms leave no dangling code, tests or commands"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "系列事实与驱动"
msgstr "Series facts and drivers"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "精确型号导出 device／startup／内存，消除固定时钟、IRQ、DMA 路线和几何假设"
msgstr ""
"Exact parts provide device/startup/memory facts, removing fixed clock, IRQ, "
"DMA-route and geometry assumptions"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "官方库与冷态行为"
msgstr "Official libraries and cold-state behavior"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "默认 F407 冷态算法已由 C 维护；扩展完整模式时继续验证 HAL／LL、回滚和排空"
msgstr ""
"Default F407 cold-state algorithms are maintained in C; continue "
"verifying HAL/LL, rollback and drain when extending complete modes"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "默认配置链路"
msgstr "Default configuration path"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "保持 Python 校验、typed IR、原子输出与输入身份；生成器只负责静态连接"
msgstr ""
"Preserve Python validation, typed IR, atomic output and input identity; the "
"generator only assembles static connections"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "精确系列覆盖"
msgstr "Exact series coverage"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "官方器件宏差异、完整料号与硬件 profile 分别验证，不以头文件数量代表功能支持"
msgstr ""
"Validate official device-macro differences, full part numbers and hardware "
"profiles separately; header counts do not represent functional support"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "软件交付"
msgstr "Software delivery"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "当前源码完整门禁、实际 SDK 消费、资源比较与独立离线构建"
msgstr ""
"Complete gates on current source, actual SDK consumption, resource "
"comparisons and independent offline builds"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "实板接入"
msgstr "Physical-board integration"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:0
msgid "实际 station 与同一镜像的启动、时钟、IRQ／DMA、失败及测量原件"
msgstr ""
"Actual station and same-image startup, clocks, IRQ/DMA, failures and "
"original measurements"

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:25
msgid ""
"Host C11 配置器是 `tools/nxconfig` 中的可选主机工具试点，当前只覆盖 Linux 上的 GPIO、UART irq-byte "
"和 SPI poll。默认配置入口仍为 Python。Host C 全面替换不作为 平台使用、固件 C 化或本轮软件交付的前置条件；它不进入 MCU "
"镜像，也不会直接改变 MCU 热路径或资源占用。后续是否扩展，按实际配置需求与主机工具维护收益单独评估。"
msgstr ""
"The Host C11 configuration tool in `tools/nxconfig` is an optional host-tool"
" pilot, currently covering only GPIO, UART irq-byte and SPI poll on Linux. "
"The default configuration entry point remains Python. Full replacement by "
"Host C is not a prerequisite for using the platform, moving firmware "
"behavior to C, or this software delivery. It does not enter MCU images or "
"directly change MCU hot paths or resource use. Further expansion is "
"evaluated separately against actual configuration needs and host-tool "
"maintenance benefits."

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:25
msgid ""
"维护者按功能批次交付 C、配置、真实回归、文档和普通提交。目录移动不宣称性能改善； 新实现与旧实现须用同一工具链和等价配置比较 ELF／map "
"与实际热路径。"
msgstr ""
"Maintainers deliver C, configuration, real regressions, documentation and "
"ordinary commits in feature batches. Moving directories claims no "
"performance improvement. Compare new and old implementations using the same "
"toolchain and equivalent configuration, including ELF/map and actual hot "
"paths."

#: docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:33
msgid ""
"默认链路的启动、停止、失败回滚、资源协调与硬件算法已由手写 C 维护；固定配置和 "
"可选诊断在编译期裁剪，通用入口复用同一实现。后续按具体需求开展精确型号适配、 运行期电源管理、完整软件候选与真实 "
"IRQ／吞吐／栈／功耗测量。当前 F4 仍拒绝 runtime power 配置，非 F407 型号仍需精确适配。软件候选与物理状态不得从旧版本"
" 继承，未执行的 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Default startup, stop, failure rollback, resource coordination and "
"hardware algorithms are maintained in handwritten C. Fixed configuration"
" and optional diagnostics are folded at compile time, and generic "
"entries reuse the same implementation. Further work follows concrete "
"needs for exact parts, runtime power management, a complete software "
"candidate and physical IRQ/throughput/stack/power measurements. Current "
"F4 configurations still reject runtime power; non-F407 parts require "
"exact adaptation. Software-candidate and physical status cannot be "
"inherited from an older version; unexecuted HIL remains `not_executed`."

msgid "STM32F4 全功能迭代清单"
msgstr "STM32F4 full-feature iteration checklist"

msgid ""
"本轮以 F407VE／ZG 为首个完整验收基准，之后按精确器件扩展 STM32F4。下表是 当前实施清单；硬件存在、软件实现、Board "
"授权和实际验证分别记录。已有子集不能 关闭整个工作包，其他 F4 器件独有的 IP 不计作 F407 缺失功能。"
msgstr ""
"This iteration uses F407VE/ZG as the first complete acceptance "
"baseline, then extends STM32F4 by exact device. The table below is the"
" current implementation checklist. Hardware presence, software "
"implementation, Board authorization and executed verification are "
"recorded separately. An existing subset cannot close a whole work "
"package; IP unique to other F4 devices is not missing F407 "
"functionality."

msgid ""
"装配关系继续遵循 [FIG-04](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)：主机生成静态 "
"数据和固定连接，factory 返回已有接口，C owner 执行硬件行为。源码责任见 "
"[FIG-31](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)。资源图和触发图用于配置 "
"校验，不在 MCU 上解释执行；新模式按需选编，不增加默认线程、heap 或全芯片对象池。"
msgstr ""
"Assembly continues to follow "
"[FIG-04](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg): host tools "
"generate static data and fixed connections, the factory returns "
"existing interfaces, and C owners execute hardware behavior. Source "
"responsibilities appear in "
"[FIG-31](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg). Resource and"
" trigger graphs validate configuration and are not interpreted on the "
"MCU. New modes are compiled when selected, without default threads, a "
"heap or chip-wide object pools."

msgid "编号"
msgstr "ID"

msgid "范围与退出条件"
msgstr "Scope and exit conditions"

msgid "状态"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "F4-01"
msgstr "F4-01"

msgid "整理器件、封装、内存、时钟、IRQ、DMA、触发和勘误事实；每项能力关联资料与实际实现"
msgstr ""
"Catalog device, package, memory, clock, IRQ, DMA, trigger and errata "
"facts; associate every capability with references and its actual "
"implementation"

msgid "已有子集，待扩展"
msgstr "Existing subset; extension pending"

msgid "F4-02"
msgstr "F4-02"

msgid "收敛模式声明与 typed IR；生成静态配置、强类型 factory 和固定连接，新增实例无需修改硬件算法"
msgstr ""
"Consolidate mode declarations and typed IR; generate static "
"configuration, a strongly typed factory and fixed connections so new "
"instances require no hardware algorithm changes"

msgid "F4-03"
msgstr "F4-03"

msgid "完整 DMA 候选映射、确定性分配、宽度与计数单位、循环与双缓冲、共享 IRQ、错误与排空验证"
msgstr ""
"Complete DMA candidate mappings, deterministic assignment, widths and "
"count units, circular and double buffering, shared IRQs, error "
"handling and drain verification"

msgid "F4-04"
msgstr "F4-04"

msgid "经审核的时钟配置、PLL／48 MHz、APB timer、ADC 预分频、Flash latency、CSS 和时间域合同"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed clock configurations, PLL/48 MHz, APB timers, ADC prescaling,"
" Flash latency, CSS and time-domain contracts"

msgid "F4-05"
msgstr "F4-05"

msgid "统一生命周期、启动依赖、SRAM／CCM／备份与外部内存、FPU／MPU／向量及失败责任"
msgstr ""
"Unify lifecycle, startup dependencies, SRAM/CCM/backup and external "
"memory, FPU/MPU/vectors and retained failure responsibility"

msgid "F4-06"
msgstr "F4-06"

msgid "完整封装合法 GPIO、AF、电气配置、EXTI line 与共享 vector；验证无毛刺准备、冲突和释放"
msgstr ""
"Cover package-valid GPIOs, alternate functions, electrical "
"configuration, EXTI lines and shared vectors; verify glitch-free "
"preparation, conflicts and release"

msgid "F4-07"
msgstr "F4-07"

msgid "六个 UART／USART 的合法格式、轮询／IRQ／DMA、半双工、流控、RS485、同步及专用模式"
msgstr ""
"Legal formats, polling/IRQ/DMA, half duplex, flow control, RS485, "
"synchronous and specialized modes for all six UARTs/USARTs"

msgid "F4-08"
msgstr "F4-08"

msgid "SPI1--3 主从、8／16 位、位序、双工、单线、TI、CRC、事务和 DMA；验证 CS／NSS、尾部完成和停止"
msgstr ""
"SPI1--3 master/target, 8/16-bit words, bit order, duplex, single-wire,"
" TI, CRC, transactions and DMA; verify CS/NSS, final wire completion "
"and stop"

msgid "F4-09"
msgstr "F4-09"

msgid "I2S2／3 主从、收发、全双工、格式、MCLK 与 DMA；明确帧、时钟误差和缓冲所有权"
msgstr ""
"I2S2/3 master/target, transmit/receive, full duplex, formats, MCLK and"
" DMA; specify frames, clock error and buffer ownership"

msgid "F4-10"
msgstr "F4-10"

msgid "I2C1--3、100／400 kHz、7／10 位、master／target、双地址、SMBus／PEC 与总线恢复"
msgstr ""
"I2C1--3, 100/400 kHz, 7/10-bit addressing, master/target, dual "
"address, SMBus/PEC and bus recovery"

msgid "F4-11"
msgstr "F4-11"

msgid "TIM1--14 按实例能力覆盖计数、PWM、捕获、编码器、单脉冲、同步、DMA burst、死区和刹车"
msgstr ""
"Cover TIM1--14 counting, PWM, capture, encoder, one-pulse, "
"synchronization, DMA burst, dead time and break according to each "
"instance capability"

msgid "F4-12"
msgstr "F4-12"

msgid "ADC1--3 通道、规则与注入组、分辨率、内部输入、模拟看门狗、多 ADC 和触发 DMA"
msgstr ""
"ADC1--3 channels, regular and injected groups, resolutions, internal "
"inputs, analog watchdogs, multi-ADC and triggered DMA"

msgid "本批扩展 ADC1 外部输入；完整工作包未完成"
msgstr ""
"This increment extends ADC1 external inputs; the full work package "
"remains incomplete"

msgid "F4-13"
msgstr "F4-13"

msgid "DAC 双通道、CPU／触发／DMA、波形输出和欠载处理；定义格式、停止电平与恢复"
msgstr ""
"Dual DAC channels, CPU/trigger/DMA, waveform output and underrun "
"handling; define formats, stopped output levels and recovery"

msgid "待实现"
msgstr "Implementation pending"

msgid "F4-14"
msgstr "F4-14"

msgid "CAN1／2 共享过滤器、ID、邮箱、FIFO、时间戳、bus-off、回环和恢复；不提供不存在的 CAN FD"
msgstr ""
"CAN1/2 shared filters, IDs, mailboxes, FIFOs, timestamps, bus-off, "
"loopback and recovery; do not expose absent CAN FD hardware"

msgid "F4-15"
msgstr "F4-15"

msgid "SDIO host 与唯一卡协议 owner；按协议覆盖 SD／MMC／SDIO function、总线宽度、DMA 与拔卡排空"
msgstr ""
"SDIO host with one card-protocol owner; cover SD/MMC/SDIO functions, "
"bus widths, DMA and card-removal drain as allowed by each protocol"

msgid "F4-16"
msgstr "F4-16"

msgid "FSMC 各受审模式、bank 与时序；区分内存窗口、设备 FIFO、NAND 页／OOB／ECC 和永久启动内存"
msgstr ""
"Reviewed FSMC modes, banks and timing; distinguish memory windows, "
"device FIFOs, NAND pages/OOB/ECC and permanently owned startup memory"

msgid "F4-17"
msgstr "F4-17"

msgid "USB FS／HS Device、Host、OTG、端点、DMA、PHY、角色与供电；中间件和控制器保持唯一状态归属"
msgstr ""
"USB FS/HS Device, Host, OTG, endpoints, DMA, PHY, roles and power; "
"maintain unambiguous state ownership between middleware and controller"

msgid "F4-18"
msgstr "F4-18"

msgid "Ethernet MII／RMII、PHY、descriptor、校验和、VLAN、SG、PTP、链路变化和异常回收"
msgstr ""
"Ethernet MII/RMII, PHY, descriptors, checksums, VLAN, SG, PTP, link "
"changes and recovery from faults"

msgid "F4-19"
msgstr "F4-19"

msgid "DCMI 数据宽度、同步、裁剪、快照／连续、JPEG 字节流与 DMA；验证帧边界、丢帧和停止"
msgstr ""
"DCMI data widths, synchronization, cropping, snapshot/continuous "
"capture, JPEG byte streams and DMA; verify frame boundaries, frame "
"loss and stop"

msgid "F4-20"
msgstr "F4-20"

msgid "RTC 日历、闹钟、唤醒、时间戳、防篡改、校准与备份域；分离 provision、adopt 和断电保持验证"
msgstr ""
"RTC calendar, alarms, wakeup, timestamps, tamper detection, "
"calibration and backup domain; separate provision, adopt and "
"power-retention verification"

msgid "F4-21"
msgstr "F4-21"

msgid "IWDG、WWDG、PVD、复位原因、时钟故障、故障记录和可选 trace；明确不可逆动作与恢复责任"
msgstr ""
"IWDG, WWDG, PVD, reset causes, clock faults, fault records and "
"optional trace; specify irreversible actions and recovery "
"responsibility"

msgid "F4-22"
msgstr "F4-22"

msgid "RNG 健康错误、固定算法 CRC、UID 与器件信息；明确实际能力与信息用途"
msgstr ""
"RNG health errors, fixed-algorithm CRC, UID and device information; "
"specify actual capabilities and information usage"

msgid "F4-23"
msgstr "F4-23"

msgid "Flash 几何、编程、擦除、镜像偏移、OTP、Option Bytes 和保护配置；隔离制造与不可逆维护"
msgstr ""
"Flash geometry, programming, erase, image offsets, OTP, Option Bytes "
"and protection configuration; isolate manufacturing and irreversible "
"maintenance"

msgid "F4-24"
msgstr "F4-24"

msgid "浅睡眠、受约束 STOP／Standby、唤醒恢复和可选逻辑时间桥接；处理旧 deadline 与 OS 时间"
msgstr ""
"Shallow sleep, constrained STOP/Standby, wakeup restoration and "
"optional logical-time bridging; handle old deadlines and OS time"

msgid "F4-25"
msgstr "F4-25"

msgid "按精确器件扩展其他 F4 子系列；相同 IP 复用，不同语义和独有外设单独实现并验收"
msgstr ""
"Extend other F4 subfamilies by exact device; reuse identical IP and "
"separately implement and qualify distinct semantics and unique "
"peripherals"

msgid "F4-26"
msgstr "F4-26"

msgid "每项新行为先执行 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 或主机 unittest RED，再实现 GREEN；完整门禁覆盖边界和失败"
msgstr ""
"Execute GoogleTest/GoogleMock or host unittest RED for each new "
"behavior before implementing GREEN; complete gates cover boundaries "
"and failures"

msgid "持续执行，不能预先关闭"
msgstr "Ongoing; cannot be closed in advance"

msgid "F4-27"
msgstr "F4-27"

msgid "同步中英文文档、框图、接入示例、Source SDK 和外部消费者；维护唯一合同和真实命令"
msgstr ""
"Keep Chinese/English documentation, diagrams, integration examples, "
"Source SDK and external consumers aligned; maintain one authoritative "
"contract and executable commands"

msgid "F4-28"
msgstr "F4-28"

msgid "精确源码与依赖绑定的软件候选、两次离线复现、HIL 工装和实际测量；软件与物理结论分开"
msgstr ""
"A software candidate bound to exact source and dependencies, two "
"offline reproducibility builds, HIL tooling and actual measurements; "
"separate software and physical conclusions"

msgid "软件候选待封存；物理未执行"
msgstr "Software candidate sealing pending; physical tests not executed"

msgid ""
"先完成 F4-01--05 的必要扩展，再用通信并发、PWM／ADC／编码器同步和显示／触摸／ "
"存储三个纵向场景检验资源模型。随后闭合常用外设与大型外设，最后扩展电源配置和 其他 F4 器件。测试、文档和 SDK "
"随每个功能包交付，不集中留到末尾。"
msgstr ""
"First complete the necessary F4-01--05 extensions, then exercise the "
"resource model through concurrent communication, synchronized "
"PWM/ADC/encoder, and display/touch/storage scenarios. Close common and"
" large-peripheral modes next, followed by power configurations and "
"other F4 devices. Tests, documentation and SDK changes accompany each "
"functional increment rather than waiting until the end."

msgid ""
"每个功能包关闭前须具备公共合同、配置选择、factory、生产 C 实现、明确 HAL／LL 归属、启停与故障回归、ARM "
"构建、资源预算和文档。完成一份接口头、SDK 编译或模型 测试不能替代其余条件；没有实物执行时，物理结论保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"Before closing a functional package, provide its public contract, "
"configuration selection, factory, production C implementation, "
"explicit HAL/LL ownership, start/stop and fault regressions, ARM "
"builds, resource budgets and documentation. An interface header, SDK "
"compilation or model test cannot replace the remaining conditions; "
"physical status remains `not_executed` without real equipment "
"execution."

msgid ""
"本轮已确定 USB Device／Host 上层采用 ST 官方中间件并按需编译，公共接口隔离厂商 类型。Device v2.11.4 与 "
"Host v3.5.3 已作为组织托管库存锁定，匹配既有 CubeF4 v1.28.3，保留 SLA0044；默认准备、编译和 SDK "
"均不选入。控制器适配与协议栈合同 仍待交付，不由此建立 Host／HS 或 class stack 支持。其他厂商依赖继续保留。"
msgstr ""
"The selected USB Device/Host upper layer uses official ST middleware "
"compiled on demand, with vendor types isolated by public interfaces. "
"Device v2.11.4 and Host v3.5.3 are pinned as organization-hosted "
"inventory matching the existing CubeF4 v1.28.3 tuple, with SLA0044 "
"retained. Default preparation, compilation and SDK payloads exclude "
"them. Controller adapters and protocol-stack contracts remain pending;"
" this inventory establishes no Host/HS or class-stack support. Other "
"vendor dependencies remain retained."
